## Make a donation

Donations help pay for hosting, research and new guides for more health conditions. Every amount helps, but please only give if you can afford to. Our help is free either way.

{% donateButton /%}

Payments are handled securely by our payment provider. We never see your card details. Juniper Health is a small business, not a registered charity, so donations are not eligible for Gift Aid.

## Other ways to help

- **Share our guides** with someone who might find them useful.
- **Tell us what to improve.** [Contact us](/contact/) with ideas or corrections.
- **Suggest a health condition** you would like us to cover next.
